### APT (Debian/Ubuntu)
```bash
# Add repository
curl -fsSL https://your-org.github.io/spooky/gpg | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /usr/share/keyrings/spooky-archive-keyring.gpg
echo "deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/spooky-archive-keyring.gpg] https://your-org.github.io/spooky/apt stable main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/spooky.list

# Install
sudo apt update
sudo apt install spooky
```

### YUM/DNF (RHEL/CentOS/Fedora)
```bash
# Add repository
sudo dnf config-manager --add-repo https://your-org.github.io/spooky/yum/spooky.repo

# Install
